      "paperId": "058fd7cfa03ce8cf668b03b78a83aad230df0997",
      "title": "The Imagination in German Idealism and Romanticism ed. by Gerad Gentry and Konstantin Pollok (review)",
      "authors": [
        {
          "name": "Jessica J. Williams",
